  <description>
    <p>A war rages on in antarctica between penguins and hostile aliens...</p>
    <p>Tux&apos;s native home of Antarctica is being invaded by a hostile alien species!!
      with one mission in mind, to harvest all of the tux pelts they possibly can!
      Will you stop them, or aid them in their dastardly mission?</p>
    <p>Mouse locks when you click on the window, press ESCAPE to unlock the mouse.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>W,A,S,D / Arrow Keys = Move</li>
      <li>L-SHIFT / R-CTRL = Sprint</li>
      <li>Left Click = Shoot</li>
      <li>Right Click = Iron Sights</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
